{"id":"f299cb3aecfed079","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-mod.md","title":"Model Set of a Theory","display":"df-mod — Model Set of a Theory","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-mod","aliases":["57-df-mod","df-mod — Model Set of a Theory"],"display":"df-mod — Model Set of a Theory","depends_on":["[[57-df-theory]]","[[57-df-structure]]","[[57-df-satisfaction]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-mod"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-mod</span><span>df-mod — Model Set of a Theory</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-mod — Model Set of a Theory"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9c053a73bd2d84c4\" href=\"?note=9c053a73bd2d84c4\" title=\"57-df-theory\">57-df-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"03dc48eb29950767\" href=\"?note=03dc48eb29950767\" title=\"57-df-satisfaction\">57-df-satisfaction</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mod}\">\\(\\mathrm{Mod}\\)</span> (模型集函数, defined in this file)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (签名, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"140b30594fbd26d8\" href=\"?note=140b30594fbd26d8\" title=\"57-df-first-order-language\">57-df-first-order-language</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi \\subseteq \\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(\\Phi \\subseteq \\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span> (句子集, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"38cb16fd577caf7b\" href=\"?note=38cb16fd577caf7b\" title=\"57-df-sentence\">57-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{A} \\in \\mathrm{Struct}_S\">\\(\\mathfrak{A} \\in \\mathrm{Struct}_S\\)</span> (S-结构, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mod} \\vdash \\mathrm{Mod}(\\Phi) \\coloneqq \\{\\mathfrak{A} \\in \\mathrm{Struct}_S \\mid \\mathfrak{A} \\models \\Phi\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mod} \\vdash \\mathrm{Mod}(\\Phi) \\coloneqq \\{\\mathfrak{A} \\in \\mathrm{Struct}_S \\mid \\mathfrak{A} \\models \\Phi\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mod}(\\Phi)\">\\(\\mathrm{Mod}(\\Phi)\\)</span>: 理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span> 的<strong>所有模型的集合</strong></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{A} \\in \\mathrm{Mod}(\\Phi)\">\\(\\mathfrak{A} \\in \\mathrm{Mod}(\\Phi)\\)</span> 等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{A} \\models \\Phi\">\\(\\mathfrak{A} \\models \\Phi\\)</span></li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 为理论，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mod}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Mod}(T)\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的所有模型的类</li>\n<li>见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"9c053a73bd2d84c4\" href=\"?note=9c053a73bd2d84c4\" title=\"57-df-theory\">57-df-theory</a> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathfrak{A})\">\\(\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathfrak{A})\\)</span> 的对偶定义（从结构到句子集）</li>\n<li>见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"4377db68f8b53b52\" href=\"?note=4377db68f8b53b52\" title=\"57-df-model\">57-df-model</a> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models\">\\(\\models\\)</span> 的定义</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-theory","status":"resolved","id":"9c053a73bd2d84c4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c136ba3960a7223a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"03dc48eb29950767","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"140b30594fbd26d8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S$ (签名, see [[57-df-first-order-language]])","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"38cb16fd577caf7b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Phi \\subseteq \\mathrm{Sent}_S$ (句子集, see [[57-df-sentence]])","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c136ba3960a7223a","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak{A} \\in \\mathrm{Struct}_S$ (S-结构, see [[57-df-structure]])","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-theory","status":"resolved","id":"9c053a73bd2d84c4","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"见 [[57-df-theory]] 中 $\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathfrak{A})$ 的对偶定义（从结构到句子集）","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"4377db68f8b53b52","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","l